'''Miko Mitama''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 5.8 Update|Version 5.8]]. She could be unlocked by rolling the [[Cat Capsule|Rare Cat Capsule]] in the [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)|UBERFEST]] or [[SUPERFEST (Gacha Event)|SUPERFEST]] events. Just like most UBERFEST exclusives, Miko Mitama serves different roles depending on what form she is using. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], she was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]] but was officially obtainable in the [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.7 Update|December 15, 2023 Update Patch]].

