==Trivia==
*This character is a reference to Japanese folklore "[[wikipedia:Kitsune no yomeiri|''Kitsune no yomeiri'']]" (狐の嫁入り, fox's wedding).
*Miko Mitama is holding a [[wikipedia:Tamagushi|tamagushi]] in her Normal Form.
*The Japanese word Mitama refers to the spirit of a kami or the soul of a dead person.
*Despite her first form's japanese description saying she is strong against all traits, she is actually resistant against all traits.

